  "description": "White freighter with '中州航空 Central Airlines' in mid grey along the forward fuselage, the Chinese ahead of the English, both at the height of the forward door. On the white fin a mosaic of square tiles forms a cross: a blue column (light blue at the top, blue, dark blue at the middle) with a blue arm forward and orange aft, a red row (crimson, red, dark red) running out to the leading edge, a dark red square below, and a green column (green, light green) down the trailing edge to the root. White engines.",
